Suggests: python3-textual, alsa-utils, vulkan-tools, mesa-utils, iw, smartmontools, bluez,
 libglib2.0-bin
Description: bring-up diagnostics for Apple silicon Macs (Aurora, development)
 aurora-diag collects bring-up diagnostics and runs regression checks on Apple
 silicon Macs; aurora-panic-log reads the panic log. It is a development tool.
 .
 Optional helpers: python3-textual (the dashboard), alsa-utils (ALSA
 controls), vulkan-tools (vulkaninfo), mesa-utils (eglinfo, glxinfo), iw
 (Wi-Fi link and regulatory domain), smartmontools (NVMe health), bluez
 (Bluetooth controller and paired devices) and libglib2.0-bin (Mutter power
 save through gdbus).
